  "description": "Loiter Electric Cruiser Bike – Power, Comfort & Adventure on Any Terrain\nThe Loiter Electric Cruiser Bike combines stunning design with top-notch performance. Equipped with two 26” x 4.0” fat tires, it offers stability and smooth handling on various terrains. The bike features a SHIMANO Tourney 7-speed rear derailleur for effortless gear shifts, dual disc brakes for reliable stopping power, and a Panasonic built-in battery for long-lasting rides. Powered by a 48V 800W XIONGDA motor, it delivers a thrilling ride with ample power. The freestyle crankset ensures efficient pedaling, while the LCD display keeps you informed of your ride status. Ideal for adventure enthusiasts, the Loiter Electric Cruiser Bike is perfect for both off-road exploration and comfortable cruising around town.\n\nSADDLE\n\nClassical Cattlehide leather with springs\n\nREAR HUB MOTOR\n48V, 800W high speed brushless max speed at 25mile\n\nEXTRAS\nTracer 26\" Loiter Beach Cruiser E-bike Shimano 7-Speed Steel Frame Disc Brake Hi Rise Handlebars Alloy Black 3\"Rims 26x4.0 Black Tires Motor 800W Panasonic Lithium-ion Battery 48V/17.5 Ah Li-ion",
